---
title: "Zanzibar Hotels & Resorts"
description: "Browse 213 hand-picked Zanzibar hotels and resorts by zone, beach and budget. Book direct or message us on WhatsApp for negotiated referral rates."
permalink: "/hotels/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Where to Stay in Zanzibar — Hotels & Resorts</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">213 hand-picked hotels and resorts across all zones. Images shown are representative zone photos (no property photos available). Book direct or WhatsApp us for negotiated referral rates.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="filters-bar">
    <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All Tiers</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="luxury">Luxury (5-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="upper-mid">Upper Mid-Range (4-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="mid">Mid-Range (3-Star)</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="standard">Guest Houses & Budget</button>
  </div>

  <section class="cards-grid hotel-grid">
    {% for hotel in hotels %}
      <article class="card hotel-card reveal" data-tier="{{ hotel.tier }}" data-zone="{{ hotel.zone }}" data-island="{{ hotel.island }}">
        <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
          {% set imgFile = hotel.name | hotelImg %}{% set meta = __metadataIndex[imgFile] %}<img src="{{ imgFile | cdnFile }}" alt="{% if meta and meta.alt_text %}{{ meta.alt_text }}{% else %}{{ hotel.name }}{% endif %}" loading="lazy">
          <span class="image-tag">Representative image</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="card-badge badge-{{ hotel.tier | lower | replace('upper-', '') }}">{{ hotel.tier | capitalize }}</span>
          <h3 class="card-title"><a href="{{ hotel.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ hotel.name }}</a></h3>
          <p class="card-meta">{{ hotel.zone }}{% if hotel.zone %}, {% endif %}{{ hotel.island }}{% if hotel.star_rating %} • {{ hotel.star_rating }}{% endif %}</p>
          {% if hotel.category %}<p class="card-description">{{ hotel.category }}</p>{% endif %}
          <div class="card-contact">
            {% if hotel.phone %}
              <a href="tel:{{ hotel.phone | replace(' ', '') | replace('+', '') }}" class="contact-item contact-phone" title="Call {{ hotel.name }}">📞 {{ hotel.phone }}</a>
            {% endif %}
            {% if hotel.whatsapp %}
              <a href="https://wa.me/{{ hotel.whatsapp | replace('+', '') | replace(' ', '') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-item contact-whatsapp" title="WhatsApp {{ hotel.name }}">💬 WhatsApp</a>
            {% endif %}
            {% if hotel.email %}
              <a href="mailto:{{ hotel.email }}" class="contact-item contact-email" title="Email {{ hotel.name }}">✉️ {{ hotel.email }}</a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <span class="card-price">{{ hotel.price_range or 'Contact for rates' }}</span>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <a href="{{ hotel.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Website</a>
              {% if hotel.facebook %}
                <a href="{{ hotel.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-social btn-sm" title="Facebook">📘</a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if hotel.instagram %}
                <a href="{{ hotel.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-social btn-sm" title="Instagram">📷</a>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p class="reveal">No properties found. Adjust your filters.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Travel Styles</span>
        <h2>Best Beaches for Your Travel Style</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Each zone has a distinct personality. Match your vibe to the right beach.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'nungwi-beach-aerial-resort-turquoise-water.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Nungwi and Kendwa — north-coast beach, nightlife and watersports" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Nungwi & Kendwa — Nightlife & Watersports</h3>
            <p>Full-moon parties, kite surfing, scuba diving, sunset dhow cruises. Best for couples and groups who want action.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-beach-women-walking-white-sand.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Paje and Jambiani — white sand beaches and turquoise lagoon" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Paje & Jambiani — Kitesurfing & Adventure</h3>
            <p>World-class kitesurfing lagoon, Kuza Cave excursions, seaweed farm visits. Laid-back vibe with easy activity access.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'stone-town-ornate-carved-door-calligraphy.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Stone Town — culture and history" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Stone Town — Culture & History</h3>
            <p>Boutique hotels in UNESCO-listed buildings. Walk to markets, museums, and the seafront. Best for culture lovers.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-rock-house-with-tourists.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Bwejuu and Michamvi — The Rock Restaurant on the southeast coast" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Bwejuu & Michamvi — Luxury & Seclusion</h3>
            <p>Boutique resorts, private beaches, The Rock Restaurant nearby. Best for honeymooners and those seeking tranquility.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="hotel-disclaimer reveal">* We partner with select properties for referral bookings. Images shown are representative zone photos — not property photos. Contact us on WhatsApp for current availability and negotiated rates.</p>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
